===Prepositional phrase===
{{en-PP}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} In [[multiple]] [[direction]]s or locations, often haphazardly; [[everywhere]].
#: {{syn|en|scattershot}}
#: {{ux|en|They started firing '''all over the place'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|In Genoa there are stray cats '''all over the place'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|I've been looking for you '''all over the place'''.}}
#* '''2004''', Ruth Ozeki, ''All Over Creation'', Penguin ({{ISBN|9781440650048}}), [https://books.google.com/books?id=garJ9BwysNEC&lpg=PA267&dq=%22all%20over%20the%20place%22&pg=PA267#v=onepage&q=%22all%20over%20the%20place%22&f=false page 267]:
#*: I couldn't believe it. “This is insanse! You don't know what you're getting into, Dad. We can't have lots of people swarming '''all over the place'''. You're supposed to be  getting rest.”
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} [[inconsistent|Inconsistent]]; lacking a clear [[pattern]]; with a large amount of [[variation]].
#: {{syn|en|at random}}
#: {{ux|en|I asked each person in turn, and their answers were '''all over the place'''.}}

